WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:02.300
<i>Yggdra.</i>

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.160
<i>During this continent's darkest hour,</i>

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.500
<i>a nameless knight rose up
and gathered a volunteer army.</i>

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.640
Why do you not understand?

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.980
Destruction is the fate 
that awaits this world.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.220
Accept it.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.060
Captain!

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.560
No.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.850
Regardless of what fate may hold,
that decision is not yours to make!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:53.050
It belongs to those of us
who live in this world!

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:57.000
We're retaking the castle!

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:57.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.150
Charge!

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.610
How futile.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:07.580
Resistance is useless.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.660
Accept your fate.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:13.970
I told you...

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.550
I will never give up!

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.310
Ridiculous.

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:21.560
Yuri!

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.720
Nothing but small-fry.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.370
Eirenus!

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:35.330
I challenge you!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.430
This should be fun.

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.090
Burn!

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.600
Bring on the destruction.

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.890
You sound like one of the bad guys.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:03.670
What?

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.790
Men, show them the might of the Ogre Tribes!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.120
What can you possibly do with so little mana?

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.340
We will seize...

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.780
our light!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.490
Look!

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:42.470
Did they do it?

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.240
Let's hurry.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.270
Phoena, give me the Chain Chronicle
and the sprite.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.380
Come, let us end the world.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.720
No, Father.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.720
How dare you?!

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:31.180
Sprite, fragment of this world's will.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.990
If you are a symbol of hope and light...

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.430
Pirika...

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.960
Then you must die.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.180
It ends here.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.580
The only thing that ends here
is you, Black King.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:49.910
Juliana!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.920
The Holy Princess!

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:54.110
I will not allow the death of my father,
the Holy King,

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:57.970
and of our many comrades
to have been in vain!

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.180
Pests.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.040
Just stay there and watch.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.190
This will all be over soon.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.170
I'm not done yet!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.370
Phoena...

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.940
No.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.700
No...

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.470
Phoena!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.110
No!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:02.840
Pirika...

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:04.870
Pirika's...

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.510
...gone.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:16.260
Behold! The Black Element increases!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.570
Magnificent!

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.770
Oh, no!

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.650
Retreat!

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.400
Understood!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.430
Phoena!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.360
Come.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:28.840
Captain!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.650
All shall be stained black.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.170
Soon, the continent of Yggdra 
will be engulfed in darkness.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:54.540
Don't tell me the kid... lost?

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.720
Pirika...

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.270
She vanished.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:19.610
The will of the world has been lost...

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:09.150
<b>Light and Darkness</b>

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.180
Phoena.

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:31.180
Let me take over.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:34.390
You won't last if you keep this up.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:38.810
It's okay. I'll be fine.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.950
The attack on the Black King has failed.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:52.220
Having failed its purpose,
the Yggdra Alliance, which we were part of,

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:54.250
has been disbanded,
as was originally agreed upon.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.960
We shall all be returning to
our respective countries.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:03.760
That Black King was far more powerful
than we had anticipated.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:08.010
Given Yuri's state, it'll take some time
before we can regroup.

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:13.600
Your Highness, I believe this operation
was reckless to begin with.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.560
How dare you?!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.690
With all due respect,
defeating the Black King

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:20.980
was too much for a mere
Volunteer Army member like Yuri.

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:22.860
Silence, Burckhardt.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.440
You're right.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.070
I understand how you feel.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:33.410
But we staked everything on Yuri
and the Volunteer Army.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:39.500
It was they that unified this
troubled continent with their passion.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.920
That's why everyone entrusted them
with their hopes for the future.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:48.010
Alas, a leader requires skill
and knowledge of strategy.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:52.260
The Black Army can't be defeated 
by skill and strategy alone.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.350
If that's the case...

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.640
All the more reason why
Her Highness Juliana should have led us.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:01.900
I could not assume that responsibility

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.770
when all I cared about
was avenging my father.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:11.860
It was none other than Yuri
who freed me from that obsession.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.830
There's no point in staying here any longer.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.170
Let's move out.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.130
What are we to do now, Leader?

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:38.850
Wayne, I will return to the Holy Capital
with the Holy Knights.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:43.810
Does Her Highness insist on
remaining with the Volunteer Army?

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:44.900
Yes.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.150
I see.

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:50.360
Under normal circumstances, I would
prefer to leave her with an escort, but...

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:53.410
Given our current situation,
I doubt we'll have any men to spare.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.990
Are you worried that Aries, Burckhardt
and I will be insufficient?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.830
I realize I'm asking a lot of you.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.540
You always have.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.790
You're right.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:10.300
Take care of Her Highness.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:12.340
Yes, Commander.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.400
Phoena?

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.190
Yuri...

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:35.740
Thank goodness.

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:40.410
You were unconscious for so long.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:47.710
We managed to escape this far,
but have no idea what to do next...

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.550
Thanks.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.220
I'm sorry.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:12:00.630
The Chain Chronicle, Pirika...

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.650
I couldn't...

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.440
It's okay.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:13.190
For now, I'm just glad you're alive.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:20.080
I'm going to go tell the others.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.800
Are you really feeling better?

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.760
Shouldn't you rest a little longer?

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:36.180
If you push yourself,
it'll come back to bite you.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.760
Yeah, I know.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.640
So, what will you do now?

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.770
I think I'll head back to the Vice Capital.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.770
So, you intend to gather
our forces again, and...

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.690
No.

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:54.070
For now, my only plan is to return
and report our losses to Gilbert.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:57.410
The Guild suffered many casualties
in this operation, too.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.620
I see.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.760
<i>All shall be stained black.</i>

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.550
<i>All shall be stained black.</i>

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.730
All shall be stained black.

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:32.690
No way.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.730
Those few coppers won't buy you nuthin'.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.700
Please, just one apple...

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.740
Move it!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.530
Hey, gimme that whole basket.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.950
The whole basket? Gladly!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.040
Two gold should cover it.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.000
Of course!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.500
Here you go.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.710
One, two...

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.050
Two gold coins.

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:59.680
Don't you think prices
are getting a little high recently?

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:02.540
Must be tough to get by if you're poor.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.180
Hey, fatso.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.770
Move your foot.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:13.520
I'm telling you to move your filthy foot!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:26.790
Here.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:32.170
Thank you.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:37.260
Hey, kid.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.180
What the hell was that for?

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:49.730
Why, you...

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.030
Ow...

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.110
Damn kid!

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:02.910
I'll teach you to make a fool outta me!

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.240
I'm taking this.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:08.790
Hey!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.000
Hey, you!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.120
Kid!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.460
You punk!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.210
Thief!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.170
You villain!

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.340
Who's the villain here?

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:24.510
I'm not the one picking on the weak.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.270
Dummy! Doofus! Bozo!

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.180
See ya!

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:33.730
Dammit!

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:41.240
Hey!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.000
Oh, you're...

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.340
Are you sure it's okay?

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.380
Yeah, one's enough for me.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:06.140
But what about for your family?

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.050
Don't have none.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:10.970
I see.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:16.900
I know. I think I'll treat you to a meal.

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:19.520
Don't worry about it.

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.050
How dare you run home
with your tails between your legs!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:27.800
What are you going to do about our land?!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:28.550
H-Hey...

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.390
Wait, we're...

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.890
You said you'd defeat the Black King!

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:35.850
That you'd protect us!

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.810
Now look at us!

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:40.570
Look!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:46.990
What are we to do now?!

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.950
What are we to do?

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.590
Hey!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:09.720
Help us!

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:12.430
What's wrong?

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:13.810
It's them.

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:15.520
It's the Black Army.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:19.100
Hurry, before the Black Fog...

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.860
All shall be stained black.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:28.650
Let's hurry.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:29.320
As you wish.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.160
Captain, let's go.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.110
Michidia!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.470
Get outta here, grandma!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.280
But...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.710
I'll be fine.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:00.470
Go!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.210
Our mana is weak.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.710
Is it because of this fog?

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:43.900
<i>All shall be stained black.</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.520
<i>Destruction is the fate 
that awaits this world.</i>

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.700
<i>Accept it.</i>

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:01.410
<i>Accept your fate.</i>

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.760
Not yet.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.840
I'm not done yet!

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:21.880
Let's finish this!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:22.730
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.290
Dammit, just a little more.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:34.810
What the?

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.580
He took my mana?

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.120
Seize the light!

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:55.560
You're Yuri of the Volunteer Army.

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:06.610
And you are?

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:12.530
I'm Aram.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>To Be With Others</b>

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:48.990
Fate is set in motion.
